    """Restore closure-captured tensors that were freed (data pointer cleared)
    between the forward and backward passes.

    During pipeline-parallel scheduling, tensors captured in the closure of the
    recomputed function may have their underlying data pointer cleared (via
    ``_clear_dataptr()``) after forward but before backward.  RecomputeFunction
